config GOODIX_FINGERPRINT
	tristate "Goodix fingerprint sensor in TEE mode"
	depends on SPI
	help
	  Say Y here to enable the Goodix GF SPI fingerprint driver running
	  in TEE (Trustonic/Microtrust) mode. Used on Xiaomi 12T (plato).

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here.
